# Normalize line endings to LF in the working tree, not just in the repository.
#
# Prettier is configured with `endOfLine: "lf"` and CI runs on Linux, so a
# Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true would check files out as CRLF and fail
# `npm run format:check` locally while CI stayed green. Declaring the working
# tree as LF keeps the documented command working on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.db    binary
